  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Annual Nigeria Cash Working Group workshop 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD aims to support the annual CWG workshop (10th -14th February 2025) This activity aims to strengthen collaboration, harmonization, and strategic planning within the Nigeria Cash Working Group (NCWG) to support the effective implementation of cash and voucher assistance (CVA) activities within Nigeria. By supporting the CWG initiatives such as the quarterly Joint Market Monitoring Initiatives (JMMI) and the annual coordination workshop, the project will provide a platform for reviewing progress, sharing lessons learned, and strategizing for the upcoming implementation period.
The CAFOD team will work closely with NCWG members to develop the workshop agenda, which will include sharing reports on the current outcomes of CVA activities with stakeholders and partners. Actionable recommendations agreed upon during the workshop will be validated, assigned timelines for achievement, and incorporated into follow-up plans to ensure effective CVA implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
